    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">This video takes a close-up look at the lowest common denominator of all life: the cell. It illustrates essential cellular processes - transportation of materials, communication, energy transfer, protein-building, waste disposal, movement, and the all-important mitosis and meiosis -- as well as key cellular landmarks like the nucleus, ribosomes, mitochondria, the Golgi complex, the endoplasmic reticulum, and lysosomes. Special attention is given to recent advances in biotechnology.</marc:subfield>
